flowchart TD
    ZG["**0. Zero Gradients**\noptimizer.zero_grad()"]
    FWD["**1. Forward Pass**\npred = model(x)"]
    LOSS["**2. Compute Loss**\nloss = criterion(pred, y)"]
    BWD["**3. Backward Pass**\nloss.backward()"]
    STEP["**4. Optimizer Step**\noptimizer.step()"]

    ZG --> FWD --> LOSS --> BWD --> STEP
    STEP -.->|"repeat for each mini-batch"| ZG

